# 🛠️ JavaScript Practice Projects

Welcome to my **JavaScript Projects** repository!  
This is a collection of small, fun, and beginner-to-intermediate level projects built to **practice JavaScript concepts** through hands-on development.

> ⚡ Built to reinforce my learning, improve logic, and get better at DOM manipulation & real-world JS usage.

---

## 🧩 Projects Included

| Project Name            | Description                                                |
| ----------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| 🎨 **Color Switcher**   | Click to switch between different background colors        |
| 🧮 **BMI Calculator**   | Calculate Body Mass Index based on user input              |
| ⏰ **Digital Clock**    | Live digital clock that updates every second               |
| 🎯 **Guess the Number** | A number guessing game with feedback and scoring           |
| 🌈 **Unlimited Colors** | Generates and displays random colors endlessly             |
| ⌨️ **Keyboard Press**   | Detects and shows which keyboard key was pressed           |
| 🪟 **Modal Window**     | A basic modal popup using HTML/CSS/JS                      |
| 🐷 **Pig Game**         | Dice-based game with two-player turn logic                 |
| 🏦 **Bankist App**      | Simulates basic banking UI with login, transfers, and more |

---

## 🔧 Tech Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript (Vanilla JS)
- DOM Manipulation
- Event Handling

---

## 🎯 Purpose

This repository was created to:

- Strengthen JavaScript fundamentals
- Practice DOM manipulation and event handling
- Build real, working features with minimal boilerplate
- Improve project structure and UI behavior

---

